  NpuInterruptLineOwnership* = object
    ## Cross-core ownership for the recovered `CNN_IRQn` numeric line.
    ##
    ## SDK `CNN_IRQn` is line 55 (`IrqBase + 39`). The D0 and E907 SDK views
    ## name that source as CNN/APU, while the M0 view excludes APU and the GLB
    ## MCU source map reuses source 39 for I2C1. M0 must therefore keep the
    ## request as data until a distinct local CNN/APU route is recovered.
    irq*: uint32
    sourceOffset*: uint32
    withinM0ClicRange*: bool
    withinGlbMcuSourceRange*: bool
    sdkCnnLineKnown*: bool
    matchesD0ApuLine*: bool
    matchesE907ApuLine*: bool
